GET {{Intellinode.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/agents/enrollment-link?macAddress=00-11-22-33-44-55

Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}



@enrollmentTokenBound = {{enrollmentLinkBound.response.body.token}}



### S2 — Enroll with wrong deviceIdentity (MAC-bound token) → 401 MacMismatch

